WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.466 --> 00:00:04.933
On their way to Ash's next Gym Battle in Coumarine City,

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.933
our heroes have come across a sprawling ranch.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.433
Wow, who knew there was a ranch out here?

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.433
Pika.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
- It's Baa de Mer Ranch.
- Hm.

6
00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:20.833
Skiddo. The Mount Pokémon. Because of Skiddo's mild temperament,

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.033
they're one of the first Pokémon to live in harmony with people.

8
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:28.000
You see, Skiddo and humans have interacted for quite a long time.

9
00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:33.533
Over there. I see Gogoat and Mareep, Dodrio and Doduo, too.

10
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.666
Also, it says this ranch has all sorts of Pokémon,

11
00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:41.666
and it's famous for its delicious cheese and ice cream made from Skiddo milk.

12
00:00:41.733 --> 00:00:44.066
Ooh, I want some. I want some.

13
00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.733
- I do, too.
- So why don't we go check it out?

14
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.100
- Hurray.
- Pika!

15
00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:54.666
The twerps are running to the Baa de Mer ranch double-time.

16
00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:56.366
Hm? Uh!

17
00:00:56.433 --> 00:01:00.233
For once, those twerps and I agree. Cheese and ice cream!

18
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.066
Eatin' that grub'd be a dream!

19
00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:03.933
Wobbuffet!

20
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:06.433
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

21
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.333
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

22
00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:11.566
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

23
00:01:11.633 --> 00:01:13.566
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

24
00:01:13.633 --> 00:01:16.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

25
00:01:16.366 --> 00:01:20.466
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

26
00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:24.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

27
00:01:24.066 --> 00:01:27.666
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

28
00:01:27.733 --> 00:01:32.333
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

29
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

30
00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.366
A Race for Home!

31
00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:49.733
It looks like that's their store.

32
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:54.200
Excuse me? Hm! Will one of you please take care of my brother?

33
00:01:54.266 --> 00:01:55.100
Huh?

34
00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:58.800
- Bonnie, no.
- You, or you. You're all keepers.

35
00:01:58.866 --> 00:02:01.800
Bonnie, I told you to stop this a million times.

36
00:02:01.866 --> 00:02:03.600
- A million one.
- Hm!

37
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.600
Bonnie, here. This is for you.

38
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.600
Thanks. Heh-heh. Yummy.

39
00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:16.200
Wow, they let you ride Skiddo, too. Oh, boy.

40
00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.000
- I wonder if this could be...
- It is.

41
00:02:21.066 --> 00:02:23.700
The first step to becoming a Rhyhorn racer.

42
00:02:23.766 --> 00:02:26.200
- Mom.
- Serena's mommy?

43
00:02:26.266 --> 00:02:29.700
- Talk about a strange coincidence.
- Its been a while.

44
00:02:29.766 --> 00:02:33.333
- How are you, dear?
- I'm fine. What are you doing here?

45
00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:38.066
I was invited here to be a special coach for the Rhyhorn racer training camp.

46
00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:40.066
Isn't that just wonderful?

47
00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:43.566
But I never thought I'd be running into you here, Serena.

48
00:02:43.633 --> 00:02:46.733
- Dear.
- Mom!

49
00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.533
Have you been doing your race training like you should?

50
00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.500
- Uh, well...
- It's so good to see all of you.

51
00:02:55.566 --> 00:03:00.100
Serena looks so happy. Thanks so much. You've taken good care of her.

52
00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:03.266
- She's been taking care of us.
- Hi-di-hi.

53
00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:05.100
- It's been a long time.
- Pika.

54
00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:08.233
You're a Rhyhorn racing camp coach, huh?

55
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:10.733
So the campers really get to ride on Rhyhorn?

56
00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:15.500
Yup. But today is for beginners, so we're starting their training with Skiddo.

57
00:03:15.566 --> 00:03:17.866
- How come?
- Rhyhorn are a bit too big

58
00:03:17.933 --> 00:03:19.466
and strong for beginners.

59
00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:22.966
That's why we start with Skiddo.

60
00:03:23.033 --> 00:03:25.633
When you hold their horns while riding them,

61
00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.966
they can actually sense your feelings.

62
00:03:28.033 --> 00:03:30.333
Even kids can ride them.

63
00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:34.800
Wow, I had no idea. You know, I started riding Rhyhorn

64
00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:37.066
- right off the bat, didn't I?
- Pika.

65
00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:41.733
That's because you said you just had to be a part of the Rhyhorn race.

66
00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:45.100
Yeah. Because you're an awesome teacher, I learned how to ride.

67
00:03:45.166 --> 00:03:48.066
Well, it's really because you worked so hard at it.

68
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:51.333
In that case, since you've ridden a Rhyhorn already,

69
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.300
there's no need to start with a Skiddo.

70
00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:56.000
But wait. I've never ridden a Skiddo before.

71
00:03:56.066 --> 00:03:58.000
- I really wanna try it.
- Great.

72
00:03:58.066 --> 00:04:00.400
I wanna ride, too.

73
00:04:00.466 --> 00:04:03.433
Those Skiddo are so cute. Can I? Can I?

74
00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.633
Yes. Why don't you all do it together?

75
00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.133
- Mm! So how about it?
- Uh... You mean me?

76
00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.266
It'll be more fun if we all ride together.

77
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:17.633
- But I don't want to.
- Serena, you'll help too, right?

78
00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.033
My hands are quite full, with all the riders.

79
00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.033
Huh? Mm.

80
00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:29.800
- All right, shall we get started?
- Yeah!

81
00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:34.266
Wow, Ash, you're great.

82
00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:36.766
Come on, really?

83
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:40.300
Here, Bonnie, I think this is the perfect Skiddo for you.

84
00:04:40.366 --> 00:04:43.800
- Yay. Huh? Oh.
- Huh?

85
00:04:43.866 --> 00:04:47.066
- Can you watch Dedenne for me?
- I'd love to.

86
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:49.966
- Uh! Denne-ne-ne.
- Pika.

87
00:04:50.033 --> 00:04:55.300
Now, get on slowly and make sure you don't speak too loudly.

88
00:04:55.366 --> 00:04:57.233
- Skiddo frighten easily.
- Right.

89
00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.266
I'd really like to make friends with you, Skiddo.

90
00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.866
So do you wanna go take a walk together?

91
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:12.566
Look at me. I'm riding. I'm riding.

92
00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:21.866
Mommy. I'm scared.

93
00:05:21.933 --> 00:05:24.200
Don't cry, dear.

94
00:05:25.633 --> 00:05:28.200
Take it slow and stay calm.

95
00:05:28.266 --> 00:05:32.200
Very few people do so well their first time.

96
00:05:32.266 --> 00:05:34.966
You've got the stuff to be a Rhyhorn racer.

97
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.933
- Hey, Clemont, are you OK?
- Yeah, I guess so.

98
00:05:50.966 --> 00:05:54.600
You see, you were nervous, so the Skiddo was nervous too.

99
00:05:54.666 --> 00:05:58.800
I can understand, but I'm not sure what can I do about it.

100
00:05:58.866 --> 00:06:02.666
- Heh. What an embarrassing big brother.
- Ugh.

101
00:06:02.733 --> 00:06:05.666
Don't worry. You'll get the hang of it soon.

102
00:06:05.733 --> 00:06:08.100
Thanks.

103
00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:12.966
- Ugh, I just can't do this.
- Come on, you're acting like a little kid.

104
00:06:13.033 --> 00:06:16.600
Bonnie! Some people are good at some things and not good at others.

105
00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:20.066
- OK, it's break time.
- Hm? Hm.

106
00:06:20.966 --> 00:06:24.966
We'll all have some lunch, then pick it up again in the afternoon, 'kay?

107
00:06:25.033 --> 00:06:26.566
OK!

108
00:06:26.633 --> 00:06:30.066
You've really become one of the students here now, huh?

109
00:06:30.133 --> 00:06:34.700
Yup. If I can learn to ride a Skiddo, then I can become a Rhyhorn racer.

110
00:06:34.766 --> 00:06:36.333
And I'm gonna do it, too.

111
00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.200
You've got what it takes. You'll get the hang of it in no time.

112
00:06:40.266 --> 00:06:43.566
- You mean it?
- Of course.

113
00:06:45.766 --> 00:06:49.466
- Is something wrong, Serena?
- It's nothing.

114
00:06:49.533 --> 00:06:51.200
- Great.
- Everyone.

115
00:06:51.266 --> 00:06:53.266
I think we should all have a nice lunch

116
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:55.500
over at the inn where I'm staying.

117
00:07:03.466 --> 00:07:06.566
Mm. I love the smell of my mom's soup.

118
00:07:06.633 --> 00:07:08.933
Wow, yeah, it smells so good.

119
00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.766
She makes the best soup in the world.

120
00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:13.400
Can't wait to try it.

121
00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:16.900
Honestly, Serena's never really been much of a cook.

122
00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:20.533
- Is that a bother?
- Not at all. She's a big help.

123
00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.600
Serena's always giving me a hand with the cooking.

124
00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:27.033
And she makes the best desserts in the whole world, all the time.

125
00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:29.600
I just love Serena's desserts.

126
00:07:29.666 --> 00:07:32.333
She always puts pretty flowers on the table.

127
00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:36.733
And she puts on a nice tablecloth. Serena's the best.

128
00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.233
- Wow, you do all that?
- I guess.

129
00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:43.900
I try to help make our mealtimes a tiny little bit more fun.

130
00:07:43.966 --> 00:07:47.566
Before you started your journey, all you did was sleep late

131
00:07:47.633 --> 00:07:49.900
and skip out on your Rhyhorn training.

132
00:07:49.966 --> 00:07:51.300
And you'd start projects

133
00:07:51.366 --> 00:07:54.300
- but you'd never finish even one.
- Huh? Mom!

134
00:07:54.366 --> 00:07:57.333
I guess that means my little girl has grown up a lot.

135
00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.133
All right. Everybody come on out.

136
00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.266
- Frog.
- Fletch.

137
00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:02.366
Cha!

138
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.666
You, too.

139
00:08:04.733 --> 00:08:05.900
- Che.
- Bun.

140
00:08:05.966 --> 00:08:08.600
- Lux.
- Come on, it's lunch time.

141
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:09.666
Denne-ne!

142
00:08:09.733 --> 00:08:13.233
Now, Fennekin and Pancham, let's eat.

143
00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.466
- Fen!
- Pancham.

144
00:08:14.533 --> 00:08:18.700
OK, Mom, say hi to Fennekin and my newest Pokémon, Pancham.

145
00:08:18.766 --> 00:08:22.266
Hi, there. Nice to meet you both. How are you?

146
00:08:22.333 --> 00:08:24.033
- Fennekin!
- Pancham!

147
00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.200
- Pika, pika! Pi!
- Hm.

148
00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.500
Looks awesome.

149
00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.166
- Chespin.
- Pancham.

150
00:08:38.233 --> 00:08:41.433
- Che... Chespin! Che, che!
- Pancham, Pancham!

151
00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.100
- Cham!
- Chespin!

152
00:08:44.166 --> 00:08:46.933
Now what are those two fighting about?

153
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.500
Just stop it. Both of you.

154
00:08:49.566 --> 00:08:51.866
-Pika, pika!

155
00:08:52.633 --> 00:08:54.866
Listen, I have an idea.

156
00:08:54.933 --> 00:08:58.366
I'd like you to do some Rhyhorn race training after lunch.

157
00:08:58.433 --> 00:08:59.866
Um...

158
00:08:59.933 --> 00:09:03.433
Look, I know you have to do your Pokémon training as well,

159
00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.433
but you still need to prepare for your future as a Rhyhorn racer.

160
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.766
- But Serena's gonna be a Pokémon perf...
- Ah!

161
00:09:09.833 --> 00:09:12.133
- Ash.
- What'd I say?

162
00:09:13.466 --> 00:09:15.800
I haven't been on my journey long.

163
00:09:15.866 --> 00:09:18.200
- Uh...
- So I haven't given it much thought.

164
00:09:18.266 --> 00:09:21.266
- Hm.
- Uh...

165
00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:25.300
Who's that Pokémon?

166
00:09:29.033 --> 00:09:30.966
It's Skiddo!

167
00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:32.800
Skiddo!

168
00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:38.500
Now, time to start afternoon training.

169
00:09:38.566 --> 00:09:39.966
Right.

170
00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:44.433
- Do I really have to?
- Of course you do. Baby.

171
00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:46.466
- Hm.
- Huh? Serena?

172
00:09:46.533 --> 00:09:50.200
Oh, I forgot something. I'll catch up with you in a bit.

173
00:09:50.266 --> 00:09:53.200
OK. I'll see you later, then.

174
00:09:58.466 --> 00:10:02.366
- Fenn?
- I'm just fine. Come on, let's practise.

175
00:10:02.433 --> 00:10:04.200
- Fenn.
- Chespin.

176
00:10:07.066 --> 00:10:09.200
Pancham, forward roll and jump.

177
00:10:09.266 --> 00:10:12.633
Pancham! Pancham!

178
00:10:12.700 --> 00:10:14.366
Fenn!

179
00:10:14.433 --> 00:10:16.533
Are you two all right?

180
00:10:17.266 --> 00:10:18.600
- Pancham.
- Fenn.

181
00:10:18.666 --> 00:10:22.566
Hm. I wonder why nothing seems to be going right.

182
00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:36.566
I guess we're just not ready.

183
00:10:36.633 --> 00:10:41.066
I can't tell my mom I wanna be a Pokémon performer if I look this awful.

184
00:10:42.433 --> 00:10:44.400
- Fenn.
- Pancham.

185
00:10:44.466 --> 00:10:47.300
I know just what you mean. And you're right.

186
00:10:47.366 --> 00:10:51.200
No way I'm gonna give up. It's just like Ash always says.

187
00:10:51.266 --> 00:10:55.000
Never give up until it's over. And I agree.

188
00:10:55.066 --> 00:10:57.400
Now let's take it once more from the top.

189
00:10:57.466 --> 00:11:00.233
- Fenn!
- Pancham!

190
00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.833
Hm.

191
00:11:02.766 --> 00:11:07.400
Ooh, là, là. A veritable mountain of cheese, yogurt, and milk.

192
00:11:07.466 --> 00:11:10.733
It'll be all-you-can-eat day every day.

193
00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.900
- My tummy says yay.
- Wobbuffet!

194
00:11:13.966 --> 00:11:16.166
- What a load.

195
00:11:16.233 --> 00:11:18.666
- OK, time to hit the road.
- Wob.

196
00:11:18.733 --> 00:11:20.700
Hold on. What do you think you're doing?

197
00:11:20.766 --> 00:11:23.766
Lets cheese it. And split.

198
00:11:23.833 --> 00:11:26.033
Come back here. Thieves!

199
00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.666
- He said thieves.
- Fenn!

200
00:11:27.733 --> 00:11:31.033
- Cham!
- I've gotta do something. Return, now.

201
00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.566
Yes, very good.

202
00:11:36.633 --> 00:11:39.533
- Come back.
- What's going on?

203
00:11:40.266 --> 00:11:41.966
They're cheese thieves.

204
00:11:42.033 --> 00:11:44.966
- They're cheese thieves?
- I knew it.

205
00:11:47.066 --> 00:11:48.400
Skiddo, after them.

206
00:11:48.466 --> 00:11:50.500
- Skid.
- Pika!

207
00:11:50.566 --> 00:11:51.500
Do.

208
00:11:51.566 --> 00:11:52.766
Stop!

209
00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:55.900
- Wait!
- Clemont?

210
00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.133
- Serena?
- Rhyhorn are faster than Skiddo.

211
00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:06.366
Rhyhorn, please. I need your help, your power and your speed, too.

212
00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.300
I need to ride with you.

213
00:12:09.366 --> 00:12:10.900
Rhy.

214
00:12:10.966 --> 00:12:12.333
Thank you.

215
00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.366
Huh!

216
00:12:14.433 --> 00:12:16.100
Serena?

217
00:12:16.166 --> 00:12:18.333
Look straight ahead.

218
00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:25.466
Sit up straight and be one with your Rhyhorn.

219
00:12:26.466 --> 00:12:28.066
Let's go, Rhyhorn.

220
00:12:28.133 --> 00:12:30.133
Rhyhorn!

221
00:12:32.866 --> 00:12:35.133
Look at that.

222
00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:38.633
Ah. Hyah! After them.

223
00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.133
Come back!

224
00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.133
Stop, please. Aaah!

225
00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:47.100
Twerps. The whole twerpish herd of them.

226
00:12:49.133 --> 00:12:52.633
Stop! Please! Oh!

227
00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.400
- Are you OK?
- Leave it to me.

228
00:12:55.466 --> 00:12:57.100
Serena?

229
00:12:57.166 --> 00:12:59.533
- Clemont, is everything all right?
- Yeah.

230
00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:02.700
- Ash, out of the way.
- Serena.

231
00:13:02.766 --> 00:13:04.333
A twerpette.

232
00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.300
Pursuing us on a Rhyhorn.

233
00:13:06.366 --> 00:13:07.333
No fair.

234
00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:10.100
Rhyhorn, I want you to use Tackle on that truck.

235
00:13:10.166 --> 00:13:13.133
Rhy! Rhyhorn!

236
00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:16.133
She's gone loco.

237
00:13:23.633 --> 00:13:25.433
All right, give it up, now.

238
00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:28.100
Prepare for trouble, don't boss us around!

239
00:13:28.166 --> 00:13:30.600
Make it double, we rule, pound-for-pound!

240
00:13:30.666 --> 00:13:32.933
To protect the world from devastation!

241
00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.666
To unite all people within our nation!

242
00:13:35.733 --> 00:13:38.566
To embrace the virtues of milk and cheese!

243
00:13:38.633 --> 00:13:42.166
We'd never forget about yogurt, puh-leeze!

244
00:13:42.233 --> 00:13:44.000
- Jessie!
- And James.

245
00:13:44.066 --> 00:13:47.733
Team Rocket blasts off with a truck full of treats!

246
00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:50.533
Surrender now while we steal your good eats!

247
00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:54.000
- Meowth, that's neat!
- Wobbuffet!

248
00:13:55.233 --> 00:13:57.733
Team Rocket. Not you guys again.

249
00:13:57.800 --> 00:14:00.466
- Give back all of that stuff.
- Pika!

250
00:14:00.533 --> 00:14:03.433
It's not stuff. Still, the answer is no.

251
00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:08.100
Here I go. Inkay, let it flow.

252
00:14:08.166 --> 00:14:09.333
Kay, Inkay!

253
00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.966
And you too, Pumpkaboo.

254
00:14:13.766 --> 00:14:14.900
Pumpkaboo!

255
00:14:14.966 --> 00:14:18.333
OK, Pikachu. Use Quick Attack.

256
00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.566
- Pika! Pika, pika!
- Inkay!

257
00:14:21.633 --> 00:14:24.766
- Psybeam, now.
- Inkay!

258
00:14:24.833 --> 00:14:26.100
Dodge it!

259
00:14:26.166 --> 00:14:29.300
- Go, Fennekin.
- Fenn!

260
00:14:29.366 --> 00:14:30.800
Flamethrower. Quick.

261
00:14:30.866 --> 00:14:33.466
Fennekin!

262
00:14:33.533 --> 00:14:37.600
Pumpkaboo. You're such a brat. Shadow Ball, stat.

263
00:14:37.666 --> 00:14:40.500
- Pumpkaboo!
- Aaah!

264
00:14:40.566 --> 00:14:43.433
- Fennekin.
- Kin!

265
00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:46.400
You're right. We won't give up.

266
00:14:46.466 --> 00:14:48.933
- Serena.
- Team Rocket.

267
00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:51.566
Now, Flamethrower, once more.

268
00:14:51.633 --> 00:14:54.200
Fennekin!

269
00:14:54.933 --> 00:14:56.766
Aaaah!

270
00:14:56.833 --> 00:14:58.733
- Pumpkaboo.
- Inkay.

271
00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:01.033
Huh, Serena.

272
00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.966
Now, Pikachu. Finish this with Thunderbolt.

273
00:15:04.033 --> 00:15:06.400
Pika! Pikachu!

274
00:15:09.166 --> 00:15:12.333
- Ahh, not one bite!
- Unfair fight!

275
00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:15.600
- Wobbuffet!
- We're taking flight!

276
00:15:15.666 --> 00:15:17.566
Wow. You guys really did it.

277
00:15:17.633 --> 00:15:20.933
I gotta say, you were really moving on that Rhyhorn.

278
00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.933
Oh, well, yeah, I guess so.

279
00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.566
- Serena?
- Huh?

280
00:15:24.633 --> 00:15:28.066
I can see now that you really do have what it takes.

281
00:15:28.133 --> 00:15:30.500
I mean, to be a professional Rhyhorn racer.

282
00:15:30.566 --> 00:15:31.566
Mom...

283
00:15:31.633 --> 00:15:35.566
I want you to come back home with me and start training again.

284
00:15:35.633 --> 00:15:37.966
Hey, that means you'd be leaving us.

285
00:15:38.033 --> 00:15:40.100
- But Serena wants...
- Hold on, Ash.

286
00:15:40.166 --> 00:15:43.233
- But, Serena.
- I'll say it.

287
00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:45.066
You see, Mom,

288
00:15:47.766 --> 00:15:51.066
I've decided I wanna become a Pokémon performer.

289
00:15:51.966 --> 00:15:54.866
Which means I'm not going home.

290
00:15:54.933 --> 00:15:56.333
Are you serious?

291
00:15:56.400 --> 00:16:00.833
Dear, as soon as you think it's getting too hard, you'll simply give up.

292
00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:05.133
I know how to settle this. We'll have a Rhyhorn race.

293
00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:08.400
- I'll come home if I lose.
- Serena.

294
00:16:08.466 --> 00:16:12.400
But Mom, if I win, you have to respect my dreams.

295
00:16:12.466 --> 00:16:13.933
That's crazy.

296
00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:17.466
Your mother's a professional Rhyhorn racer, after all.

297
00:16:17.533 --> 00:16:18.833
He's right.

298
00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:21.466
In that case, well have our race on Skiddo.

299
00:16:21.533 --> 00:16:24.866
I agree. Let's go.

300
00:16:26.066 --> 00:16:28.133
Serena can't win, can she?

301
00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.966
I'm sure she'd lose in a Rhyhorn race,

302
00:16:31.033 --> 00:16:34.966
but in a Skiddo race, I think she might just have a chance.

303
00:16:35.033 --> 00:16:39.200
Right. Compared to Rhyhorn, Skiddo do much better with a light rider.

304
00:16:39.266 --> 00:16:42.866
And that favours you. But we'll see.

305
00:16:42.933 --> 00:16:45.700
The race is one lap around the training grounds.

306
00:16:45.766 --> 00:16:47.266
And first to the goal wins.

307
00:16:47.333 --> 00:16:51.133
- Serena? Sound good?
- Hm.

308
00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.033
- Fenn!
- Go for it, Serena.

309
00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:56.433
Ready? And you're off!

310
00:17:04.966 --> 00:17:07.900
- Go, Serena!
- She's ahead.

311
00:17:07.966 --> 00:17:11.900
Faster, faster, faster, faster, faster, faster!

312
00:17:11.966 --> 00:17:13.833
Serena took the lead!

313
00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:18.099
-Serena!

314
00:17:28.666 --> 00:17:30.466
Not yet.

315
00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.400
I won't quit until the end.

316
00:17:37.466 --> 00:17:40.466
Ski, ski, ski, ski, ski, ski!

317
00:17:40.533 --> 00:17:41.533
Ski, ski, ski...

318
00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:45.366
I wasn't thinking about the future when I started my journey.

319
00:17:45.433 --> 00:17:48.966
I set out because I didn't wanna be a Rhyhorn racer like Mom said.

320
00:17:49.033 --> 00:17:54.366
But then I met Ash, Clemont, Bonnie, Fennekin and Pancham.

321
00:17:54.433 --> 00:17:58.600
And after going through so much together, I finally have a dream.

322
00:17:58.666 --> 00:18:01.933
I've finally found what it is that I wanna do.

323
00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.600
And I'm not giving up.

324
00:18:03.666 --> 00:18:06.533
Ski, ski, ski, ski...

325
00:18:11.566 --> 00:18:13.533
Look. She's catching up.

326
00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.633
- Way to go, Serena.
- Just a little bit more.

327
00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:20.633
- Faster, faster, faster.
- She's serious, isn't she?

328
00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:24.200
Ski, ski, ski, ski...

329
00:18:24.266 --> 00:18:26.533
Ski, ski-i-i-i-i-i-i!

330
00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:28.366
Finish!

331
00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:31.400
Yeah! Ha-ha-ha!

332
00:18:31.466 --> 00:18:34.700
- She did it! Yeah.
- She did it! Awesome! She did it!

333
00:18:34.766 --> 00:18:37.133
- Yes! That's awesome!
- Yay! Serena!

334
00:18:37.966 --> 00:18:40.900
Serena. Looks like you won.

335
00:18:40.966 --> 00:18:44.900
But, Mom, you see, it's just...

336
00:18:44.966 --> 00:18:47.100
Right. I understand.

337
00:18:47.166 --> 00:18:48.266
Huh?

338
00:18:48.333 --> 00:18:54.133
I understand how you feel. You know, you needn't be so surprised, sweetheart.

339
00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.233
After all, I'm your mother.

340
00:18:58.300 --> 00:18:59.733
Oh, Mom.

341
00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:03.033
I saw that secret performance practising of yours.

342
00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:04.866
You... you saw?

343
00:19:04.933 --> 00:19:08.000
And racing while covered in mud, you didn't give up.

344
00:19:08.066 --> 00:19:09.366
You raced to the end.

345
00:19:09.433 --> 00:19:13.600
You've really grown during your journey with Ash and all your wonderful friends.

346
00:19:14.433 --> 00:19:16.600
Hm. Thanks, Mom.

347
00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:18.566
Skiddo can sense feelings.

348
00:19:18.633 --> 00:19:22.900
That's the reason we raced with them, to sense your feelings.

349
00:19:22.966 --> 00:19:24.100
Ski.

350
00:19:24.166 --> 00:19:28.100
The Skiddo picked up on your dream. They could sense how strong it is.

351
00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.333
So I decided that's good enough for me.

352
00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.266
Follow your dream.

353
00:19:38.333 --> 00:19:43.333
Thank you! Mom! Mm!

354
00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:47.333
That's awesome, Serena. Let's both follow our dreams together.

355
00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:50.800
- Hm. Fennekin!
- Fenn! Fenn!

356
00:19:52.033 --> 00:19:56.266
- Mm!
- Fenn! Fennekin! Fennekin!

357
00:19:58.333 --> 00:20:02.066
- Thanks, Mom. Stay well.
- You too, Serena.

358
00:20:02.133 --> 00:20:05.566
- By the way, where to next?
- Coumarine City's next.

359
00:20:05.633 --> 00:20:09.966
I'm gonna challenge the Gym there to get my fourth Kalos Gym badge.

360
00:20:10.033 --> 00:20:13.533
You know, I hear they're going to have a Pokémon Showcase

361
00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:14.966
in Coumarine City.

362
00:20:15.933 --> 00:20:18.733
Why don't you be a part of it?

363
00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:21.466
- Really?
- Take on every challenge

364
00:20:21.533 --> 00:20:24.500
and rise above 'em all.

365
00:20:24.566 --> 00:20:27.366
Mm. Mm-hm! Hm!

366
00:20:27.433 --> 00:20:31.533
Serena was finally able to share her real dreams with her mother

367
00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.966
and show her how much she's grown.

368
00:20:34.033 --> 00:20:38.000
And, not only is Coumarine City the site of Ash's next Gym Battle,

369
00:20:38.066 --> 00:20:40.866
a Pokémon Showcase awaits Serena there as well.

370
00:20:40.933 --> 00:20:43.233
Will our two heroes emerge triumphant?

371
00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:47.700
The answer to come, as the journey continues.
